window.products.push({"id":947047,"name":"WiFi Temperature Monitor Smart Thermometer: WiFi Temperature Sensor with 1M Waterproof External Probe, App Alert & Buzzer Alarm, Digital Remote Temper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m11X7SXDL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"REAL-TIME DATA UPDATE & DUAL ALARM MODE: WiFi Thermometer(No 5GHz WiFi support), Controlled by Tuya Smart/Smart Life App. Real-time update without delay. When beyond preset value, App Alerts will be sent and the Buzzer will sound. Our Indoor temperature sensor also supports ℃/℉ reading and Temperature calibration. ALWAYS ACCURATE & WIDER APPLICATIONS: Smart hygrometer accesses temperature accurately within ±0.5℃. With an external waterproof probe to monitor the temperature to ensure a stable connection and low temperature-resistant. The temperature working range can reach: -40°F to +257°F (-40°C to +125°C). Perfectly suitable for monitoring refrigerator, freezer and laboratory. No problem with water temperature monitoring also. INTELLIGENT LINKAGE FUNCTION: Set your smart routine in the app. For example, You can set a condition in the smart scene is that the air-conditioner is turn on when the ambient temperature surpass 80°F. As long as the devices are compatible with the Tuya/Smart Life app, you can synchronize more smart devices. BUILT-IN RECHARGEALBE BATTERY & EASY TO INSTALL: Smart temperature sensor powered by DC5V power adapter with USB able. Built- in a rechargeable backup battery, When the external power is outage, the battery can continue to work for 6 hours. Tuya temperature sensor with magnet on the back, could be attached to the metal surface directly. You can also install it anywhere with the included 3M sticker FREE HISTORY RECORD & SHARING WITH OTHERS: The history record data of temperature can be exported from App. You can also share the Indoor Thermometer with your family to monitor the temperature together. GAODUCASH provides 24-month warranty of Digital Freezer Thermometer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m11X7SXDL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gaoducash","source_asin":"B0B79N7VP7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B79N7VP7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B79N7VP7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
