window.products.push({"id":947100,"name":"Korean BBQ Grill Indoor Grill Electric Smokeless Portable Small Kitchen Appliances with Metal Drip Tray Griddle Barbecue Grills for Party Cooking Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r3a1SMwuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Electric Grill Indoor BBQ] - The indoor grills has a 1800W power with non grill lid design, allow us to watch the cooking and turn over the food at any time, which offer us a real barbecue experience when BBQ inside or outdoor. The 3U-shaped heating tube has a larger heating area, so that the food is heated evenly and good to keep locked the moisture and nutrition of the food. [Detachable and Easy to Clean] - The entire korean bbq indoor grill is detachable and each part can be easily assembled and disassembled, which is very convenient for cleaning up the remaining oil. Due to the recessed design of the grill body,can fill water in advance to prevent the grill from drying out and easy to wash (PLEASE ALWAYS ADD WATER and DO NOT OVER the top line on to avoid overheating or boiling, and it is normal that food itself produce water vapor during heating) [Constant Temperature System] - The thermostat can automatically keep the temperature constant so that the table top grill temperature does not exceed 260 ℃/500℉ In order to protect the nutrition and taste of food. (Do not flush the thermostat with water.) [Safe and Healthy Cooking] - This indoor grill uses heating pipes that have passed the explosion proof high temperature testd and combined with food grade grill nets and drip trays, so there is less oily smoke emissions during the cooking process. [Ideal Barbecue Area] - Smokeless indoor grill is 15.2 x 9.6 inch, which is suitable for 2 to 5 people. It is ideal choice for you to cook when you need to barbecue indoor and outdoor. Such as office, home, backyard, garden and etc for celebrating Christmas, Halloween, or other festivals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r3a1SMwuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TONZE","source_asin":"B09L144WJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L144WJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L144WJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
