window.products.push({"id":947244,"name":"Dom're Premium Hotel Collection Bed Pillows Queen Size Set of 2 - 100% Virgin Gel Fiber Down Alternative Pillow - Colling Cotton Pillow Case - for Bac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KflYPFGYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Complete Luxury Bed Pillow Set - experience the luxury of the Dom're Down Alternative Pillows, crafted from the finest Down alternative fiber called 100% Virgen gel for a sumptuous yet supportive, heavenly-like surface for your head. The pillows are encased in a luxurious, cool breathable 100% cotton cover, making them a soft cooling accessory. Backed by a 90-day warranty. Improved Sleep Quality - Our 2-pack Dom're Luxury large Queen Sized 100% Virgen gel Down alternative plush pillows are designed to provide optimal comfort and support for the head, neck, and shoulders. This ensures that the user is able to sleep in a comfortable and supported position throughout the night, leading to improved sleeping quality. Cooling Organic Pillow Covers - Like the shell of the fluffy Dom're pillows, the included 100% Egyptian cotton pillowcases are crafted of the most luxurious breathable cotton that helps each sumptuous pillow stay cool - ideal for sensitive skin Effortless Washing - The 2 pillows are machine-washable and dryer-friendly for quick and easy care. Wash each cooling pillow in cold water on a gentle cycle with like colors, then tumble dry on low. Comfortable Pillows for Sleeping - The Dom're Luxury 100% Virgen gel Down alternative 2-pack is the perfect solution for any type of sleeper. Whether you are a stomach, back, or side sleeper, this product offers unparalleled comfort and support. The premium 100% Virgen gel down alternative fill helps regulate body temperature and is hypoallergenic, making it ideal for those with allergies. Its breathable fabric allows for air circulation, which keeps the sleeper cool and dry throughout the night","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KflYPFGYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOM'RE DREAMS","source_asin":"B0BHJN7B48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHJN7B48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHJN7B48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":947245,"name":"Primula Cold Brew Travel Bottle with Black Insulating Neoprene Sleeve - Borosilicate Glass and Stainless Steel Mesh Core - Dishwasher Safe - 20 oz. - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OfvcrR0tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Primula, we create items by exploring how people prepare beverages in different cultures and work to understand the experience and ritual behind these preparations. Identifying why people love different and unique beverages is the first step in our creative process, and our products are designed to connect with that rationality. Crafted from temperature safe borosilicate glass while utilizing a super fine stainless steel mesh that doesn't alter flavor, our Cold Brew Travel Bottle is the ideal solution for enjoying delicious cold brewed coffee on the go. Guaranteed to make refreshing cups of iced coffee, our Cold Brew Travel Bottle produces coffee that's up to 65% less acidic and naturally sweeter than any heat brewed variety. It's the perfect accoutrement for creating rich, smooth, and icy cold coffee to jolt you awake in the morning or to make it through those long summer days. With a minimal physical footprint, the Primula Cold Brew Travel Bottle is incredibly useful for out of the house expeditions! Its slim design makes it perfect for storage in a suitcase, canvas bag, shoulder bag, backpack, and more, and the insulating neoprene sleeve has a carry strap for easy access. Get brewing!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OfvcrR0tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Primula","source_asin":"B07CL7VPKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CL7VPKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CL7VPKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
