window.products.push({"id":947307,"name":"KENSHI 7 Inch Santoku Chef Knife with 67 Layer, Damascus Steel Blade with Japanese VG10 Core and Ergonomic Grip + Free sharpening manual","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mz61IThZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Are you a chef or home cook in search of a versatile, Japanese-style kitchen knife that does it all? The KENSHI 7 Inch Santoku Knife is it! This kitchen utility knife features a classic Santoku design, with a well-balanced, cleaver-like shape that allows for optimal cutting leverage and full use of the blade. The blade has 67 layers of high-carbon, super-strength, forged steel around a VG10 core. It’s imported from Japan and wrapped in stainless Damascus. This blade retains its sharp edge for years and rarely requires sharpening! Use our Santoku knife for an array of food prep tasks including finely slicing meats and fish, chopping herbs, and dicing veggies. You’ll love how comfortable and sturdy the ergonomic pakkawood handle feels in the palm of your hand. Not only is the KENSHI 7 Inch Santoku Knife one of the sharpest kitchen knives you’ve ever used to prepare food; it also looks beautiful on your countertop. Plus, it’s so easy to care for. Hand washing is advised, but this slicer / cutter is dishwasher safe. Our Japanese style Santoku knife comes attractively presented in a sturdy box and makes a FABULOUS GIFT for the gourmet home cook or even a professional chef. Click ‘ADD TO CART’ to buy now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mz61IThZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KENSHI","source_asin":"B01M99DUD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M99DUD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M99DUD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":947308,"name":"vekpps Electric Can Opener, Kitchen Can Opener with Smooth Edges and Light Weight, best Kitchen Gadget for Chefs, Housewives and Old Man (Red)(icoox)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dnPGu-HQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Technical Specifications ✬Operate voltage: DC2.4-3V ✬Battery: 2xAA alkaline or rechargeable batteries(Battery Not Included) How do I open the battery compartment? ↪Step1 - Face the back of the can opener to someone and hold the can opener with both hands ↪Step2 - Two thumbs side by side on the back of the can opener ↪Step3 - Slide your thumb down hard How to operate a can opener ↪Step1 - Hold top of unit with left hand, thumb on top, fingers on the bottom and using the right hand, place thumb and index fingers on indentations of rubber grip. ↪Step2 - Rotate rubber grip upward to access battery compartment. Lower the rubber grip and push back into original position. ↪Step3 - Place your Mini Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove at the bottom of Mini Can Opener. ↪Step4 - With the can on a flat surface, Press the Start button for about one second and release it once the Mini Can Opener starts to cut the can. After cutting, the Mini Can Opener will stop automatically. Trouble Shooting: √If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery icoox Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. √Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. √If the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of the can opener","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dnPGu-HQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vekpps","source_asin":"B09LH9ZFRP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LH9ZFRP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LH9ZFRP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
