window.products.push({"id":947325,"name":"Aromatique Pumpkin Spice Potpourri Bag 8 oz - Home Fragrance Decor, Perfect Fall Decoration Long Lasting Room Air Freshener Deodorizer Sachet Botanica","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LcBubqRgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Exude a sense of warmth and comfort with this Aromatique Pumpkin Spice Potpourri Bag. Using this decorative fragrance adds a warm, comforting touch to any space. Pumpkin Spice instantly refreshes a room with the aroma of spiced candied pumpkin accented with ribbons of vanilla, maple, and cherry. The botanical blend is perfect for fall décor or to fill your home with an inviting scent of cinnamon and nutmeg flavor while the warming notes of vanilla and clove add an earthy dimension. Aromatique is a simple, yet beautiful way to create the perfect ambiance wherever you go. Our blends are handcrafted with only the finest botanicals, creating beautiful home decor or exquisite gifts! The Aromatique Pumpkin Spice Potpourri Bag contains real fall harvest botanicals that will fill your home with a vibrant fall fragrance. Perfect for centerpieces and table settings, catchall bowl fillers, or just to create an ambiance on your coffee table. The perfect fall potpourri to fill your home with the fragrance of fresh pumpkin and warm spices infused with our special blend of dried botanicals. Our decorative fragrance performs better than other potpourris on the market because we utilize highly fragranced wood chips and other carriers that allow our fragrances to stay fresher longer. These types of porous materials also allow the fragrance to be released into the air for maximum strength, leading you to the best experience possible. Perfect for fall decorating, this pumpkin spice potpourri will fill your home with a festive aroma. Simply place the potpourri on an open dish in the center of your kitchen or dining table to create a beautiful touch of fall ambiance. You can also use it to freshen up the air in a closet or catch-all drawer. Fragrant and decorative, this pumpkin spice potpourri bag is the perfect addition to your home. Add warmth, comfort and overall ambience to your home decor with Aromatique Potpourri. This fragrance is bursting with the aroma of pumpkin spice, toasty vanilla and hints of red cinnamon. This scent will elevate any space while adding a warm, inviting glow to any room or gathering place. The spices are blended perfectly with sweet maple and light fall fruits like cherry & balsam to give it depth and intensity. The botanicals give off a delightful aroma that instantly brightens your space and creates a warm, inviting feeling. Use Time: Up to 4 weeks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LcBubqRgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aromatique","source_asin":"B07XFSF362","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XFSF362","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XFSF362","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
