window.products.push({"id":947496,"name":"VIAGDO Makeup Vanity with Lights, Vanity Desk with Mirror & 3 Color Lighting Modes, Vanity Table with Charging Station, Makeup Desk with Drawers and C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NCNaoipvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Coffee Table with Charging Station】Enjoy the power at hand! The charging coffee table with power outlets is arranged with 2 AC Outlets, 1 USB Port, 1 TYPE-C USB Port that supports super charging. A 4.9ft long power cable allowing you to charge multiple mobile devices, easy to use within arm’s reach, making it an ideal design for leisure, online work, education, convenient and practical. 【2-in-1 Coffee Table with Lift Top】Lift the wooden tabletop to get a workstation for working at home, or lower the tabletop to own a cocktail/tea table or dinning table while watching TV, you can easily switch between work and rest modes. The high-quality lifting top mechanism enables the desktop to be raised and lowered easily and silently, ideal for working, dining, and offers extra storage in the living room or office. 【Coffee Table with Ample Storage】The hidden compartment under lift tabletop is designed to store often-used items away from dirt, yet out-of-sight when not in use. The open shelves can hold snacks, books, magazines and a variety of items to keep your room neat and organized. There’s a storage cabinet with magnetic door under the fixed part for easy reach, handy and convenient. 【Heavy Duty Coffee Table】Made of CARB P2-compliant MDF and rigid metal frame, this coffee table for living room not only provides excellent stability and durability but also offers you a safe and healthy environment. With melamine veneer finish, this rustic coffee table is water repellent, easy to clean, wear resistant and adds a contemporary touch to your room. 【Easy Assembly】Package includes the labeled parts, detailed installation manual and setting tool, you can easily finish assembly step by step. Please feel free to contact us if there’s any questions about this product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NCNaoipvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIAGDO","source_asin":"B09MVVVPM7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MVVVPM7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MVVVPM7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
