window.products.push({"id":947507,"name":"Taiwon Metal Stainless Steel Modern space pattern flatware 60-piece Set plus 3-piece bonus, Service for 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617esw2y2wL._AC_SL1350_.jpg","description":"Modern Space is very simple and classy pattern of Taiwon Metal Industry. This pattern became one of the most widely used patterns since 2003. Designer got inspiration from space and its mystique. This includes: 12 Soup Spoon - 6.7 inch, 12 Dinner Knife - 8.5 inch (Luxury Hollow Handle), 12 Tea Spoon - 5.1 inch, 12 Salad Fork - 6.5 inch, 12 Dinner Fork - 7.1 inch There is a bonus of 1 Serving Spoon +1 Serving Fork + 1 Butter Knife Material Information18/10 and 18/0 is not the same quality of material used and vary considerably in price and composition. Stainless flatware that is 18/10 means that the material is consist of 18% chromium and 10% nickel. Similarly, 18/8 is 8% ofickel and 18/0 is 0%. The higher the nickel content, the more protection the flatware has from corrosion. Water and dishwasher detergents tend to be harsh to stainless steel flatware and that can sometimes cause blemishes. These can often be removed with a stainless steel cleanser but pitting, chipping or rusti","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617esw2y2wL._AC_SL1350_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenWide Corp","source_asin":"B007MH7TVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007MH7TVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007MH7TVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":947508,"name":"Air Purifiers for Large Room, Quiet Air Purifier for Home Bedroom Up To 1596 Sq Ft, Auto Mode, Remote, Remove 99.99% of Particle, Pet Allergies, Smoke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dZYXURZ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【HIGH PERFORMANCE】Breathe easy with the VCK H14 True HEPA Air Purifier. With a powerful motor optimized for air cleVCKaning performance, this purifier can clean spaces up to 798 ft² in just 30 minutes or 319ft² in 12 minutes (CADR: 208 CFM / 353 m³/h). Certified safe by ETL, FCC, and EPA, this air purifier is perfect for any family. 【3-Stage H14 HEPA Filter】Featuring a 3-stage H14 HEPA filter system, the VCK air purifier eases sneezing, congestion, and other allergy symptoms caused by airborne contaminants. This filter captures 99.997% of airborne particles 0.3 microns in size, including pollutants, pet allergens, smoke, mold, pet dander, pollen, dust, odors, and VOCs. It's even more powerful than a HEPA 13. 【LED Screen & Remote Control】With an LED screen and remote control, the VCK air purifier is easy to operate in sleep mode, powerful mode, auto mode, and 3 fan modes (low, medium, and high). The built-in PM2.5 sensor in auto mode monitors air quality and automatically adjusts fan speed if pollutant levels are detected. It's easy to set all modes using the remote or the control panel. 【Sleep More Soundly】Choose Sleep Mode at night for quiet operation at just 10dB, ensuring a good night's rest. The display brightness can be automatically turned off for undisturbed sleep. The child lock design ensures safety and helps avoid any accidental setting changes. 【Sleek Design】With a sleek modern design, this air purifier fits in any space from small to large rooms, bedrooms, living rooms, offices, nurseries, kitchens, and basements, blending in with your decor. The filter replacement indicator icon will show on the LED display when the filter expires, suggesting it's time for a replacement. 【Official Filters】For the best fit and filtration, use VCK H14 True HEPA filters (ASIN: B0BPC8M23T). Independent filter elements are also available for purchase. We recommend replacing the filter every 6 months depending on the environment and usage frequency to ensure optimum performance. Give your home the fresh air it deserves with VCK.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dZYXURZ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VCK","source_asin":"B0C4YPWMLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4YPWMLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4YPWMLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
