window.products.push({"id":947547,"name":"Ravs Butane Torch, Refillable Kitchen Torch Lighter, Blow Torch with Safety Lock， Adjustable Flame, Food Cooking Torch for Searing Steak, Baking, Dess","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Uo+pDfXwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you want a gun torch with a bigger flame, please search 👍Ravs Powerful Cooking Torch👍 on the Ravs store. 🔥【 SAFETY & DURABLE】The butane torch made from a strong Aluminum alloy body ensures durable and long-lasting use. This kitchen torch comes with safety locks to avert accidental ignition and prevent children from lighting the torch. The sturdy base design provides excellent support to the rest of the butane torch body. After usage, you can easily place this on the tabletop. 🔥【 ADJUSTABLE FLAME & ROTATING ANGLES】The flame regulator allows you to easily control the flame and allows flame temperature up to 1300 °C / 2372 °F. You can use longer flames for brazing or cooking and shorter flames for detailed jewelry work. A unique 90-degree adjustable angle nozzle allows you to adjust the angle from 0-90° according to your cooking or work needs. 🔥【 REFILLABLE & FIT ALL BUTANE TANKS】 It's very easy to refuel this torch. It comes with two red adapters and one exhaust rod that can support any brand of butane and can be refueled in a matter of seconds. So, you can do your work easily. (Butane Gas NOT INCLUDED) 🔥【ONE-HANDED OPERATION】Butane torch features a premium ignition system that does not require any external source for lighting. Continuous flame mode for easy to operate. Press the ignition button to light the fire, push up to close the safety lock at the same time, then it will keep the fire. Push down the safety lock, the flame will go out. This cooking torch is equipped with a built-in finger guard that is ergonomic, sturdy, and long-lasting to protect fingers from extreme heat and burns. 🔥【 A VERSATILE GIFT】 This versatile design micro torch can be used for a variety of tasks. Chefs Torch is great for caramelizing food, barbecue steaks, roast peppers, melting cheese, and toasting crumbs. But the usage of this torch is not limited to the kitchen only. It's also can be used for various purposes like plumbing, soldering, brazing, jewelry making, dental, camping, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Uo+pDfXwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ravs","source_asin":"B0B6ZLTRCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6ZLTRCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6ZLTRCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
