window.products.push({"id":947577,"name":"Simply Glamour Mixed Gemstone Crystal Healing Water Bottle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZR-Bl8fBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This isn’t a regular water bottle, this luxurious water bottle contains a powerful crystal that will balance the energy around you. Infuse your life with the power of a wonderful mix of crystal quartz while staying hydrated. gem water infused with crystals will naturally help you lead a more positive life whilst nourishing every cell within. Made from the stone of unconditional and infinite love. Bring self-love, friendship, and romance into your life. Crystals also promotes health, peace and spiritual growth and strengthens feelings of calm, bliss and trust. If any issues with any leaking please make sure the rubber seal has not moved out of place during shipping, otherwise please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZR-Bl8fBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Glamour","source_asin":"B08XQZRZXC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XQZRZXC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XQZRZXC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":947578,"name":"Deluxe Round Colorful African Basket - 10\" (small) - by market women in Bolgatanga, Ghana with Africa Heartwood Project - GBSRC (Flat-packed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jlA+ZirhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Deluxe Small Round Colorful African Basket from Africa Heartwood Project is custom designed by the artist herself with any variety of beautiful geometric patterns in assorted colors. Each is unique, like the woman who made it! This is the compact size, measuring about 9-10\" round and 6\" tall, plus the 3\" handle for 9\" approximate total height. They're each equipped with durable, soft leather handles and the small 10\" size is suitable for use in collecting eggs or herbs, displaying soaps or dish cloths, storing small crafts, or displaying a small pot of flowers, and of course as a stunning home decor accent. ----------- Each deluxe basket in our collection is made from the elephant grass which grows in the rich flood plains of the White Volta near the village of Bolgatanga, Northern Ghana. We love that women artisans, working in family & village co-operatives, hand-weave each basket using traditional techniques handed down from generation to generation. Non-profit Africa Heartwood Project supports the sustainable livelihoods of cultural artisans in developing countries by providing training, investment, and access to global markets. ---------- Your new basket will come either flat-packed or fully-shaped - you choose which! To save money select flat-packed, reducing storage and shipping costs. Easily reshape by simply spraying or immersing in water, shaking of excess water, hand shaping while wet, then allowing to air dry. 5 minutes of basket love and your done! Or, select fully-shaped and you'll get a basket we have already soaked, shaped, and dried, so it comes delivered to you ready to use or display. Either way, we include a care and shaping guide to help you keep your basket looking its best. --------- Pictures and specifications are provided for reference only. Every basket is hand made and unique, but have confidence that your new basket will very closely match the written description and photos.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jlA+ZirhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Africa Heartwood Project","source_asin":"B0B1TDC9D8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1TDC9D8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1TDC9D8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
