window.products.push({"id":947591,"name":"Mama Bear Candle, Gifts For Mom, Candles For Home, Mom Birthday Gifts, Mothers Day Gift, Christmas Gifts For Mom, Camper Decor, Holiday Gift, Gifts Fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ccWofnwlL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Everything in our shop is MADE TO ORDER. Please read our listings thoroughly. :)  Mama Bear Soy Wax Candle - Pick Your Scent!  PLEASE REFERENCE SCENT CHART FOR AVAILABLE SCENTS WHEN ORDERING.  Our candles are ALL Handmade TO ORDER. Every single label is made per order here in our shop. Our candles are made in small batches and hand poured. We use 4oz MINI Jars, 8oz Jars and 16oz Mason Jars. Our candles are Eco-friendly and dye free. We use 100% Natural Soy Wax that is produced from American Grown Soybeans. Soy Wax offers a longer burn time and a cleaner burn than paraffin-based candles. We use 100% cotton wicks for a cleaner burn. Our fragrances and candles are Cruelty Free and Vegan Friendly. Each individual candle comes packaged in a box ready to gift.  *Approximate Jar Dimensions* -4oz MINI Jar - 2.5\" H x 2.5\" D -8oz Jar - 3.5\" H x 2.75\" D -16oz Mason Jar - 5\" H x 3\" D  We offer Rustic Bronze or Silver Lids. THE MINI Jar ONLY comes in SILVER. Reference photos for candle sizes & lid colors. LID CHOICE IS SUBJECT TO CHANGE UPON PRODUCT AVAILABILITY. YOU MAY RECEIVE A DIFFERENT COLOR THAN ORDERED.  **Our Average Burn Times with Proper Care** -4oz MINI Approximately 25-30 hours -8oz Approximately 40 to 55 hours -16oz Approximately 70 to 100 hours Our candles burn 30-50% longer than paraffin-based candles.  *USAGE* -During the first burn, allow the candle to melt all the way to the edges of the jar. -Trim the wick to 1/4\" before burning each time. -Do not burn the candle longer than 3 to 4 hours. -Do not leave the candle unattended while burning. -Keep the candle away from drafts, children, pets & flammable items. -Discontinue use of the candle when only 1/4\" of wax remains.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ccWofnwlL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B06XR4ZWXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XR4ZWXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XR4ZWXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
