window.products.push({"id":947633,"name":"Disposable Chopsticks Bamboo From Shark Tank 25 Pack Cropsticks Built-in Rest (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UK6-AqABL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You will never use another chopstick again! il. It's bamboo chopsticks that come with a built-in rest made from sustainable bamboo. 25 Cropsticks packaged in a box and ready for your next party! It's chopsticks with a built-in-rest and made from sustainable bamboo. first product to market is called Cropsticks, an innovation on the every day chopstick. With Cropsticks, you now have a built-in rest which is authentic to the Asian dining experience. Cropsticks are made from fast growing bamboo. Currently, 45% of one time use chopsticks are still made from trees. That’s around 36 billion chopsticks contributing to deforestation and increased carbon emissions. Chop a tree down, it’s gone forever. But chop down bamboo, it grows right back. Once Cropsticks are used, restaurants have the option to upcycle our product into beautiful tiles made for shelving, flooring, table tops and more. We like to think it’s being sustainable at full circle. disposable bamboo chopsticks;","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UK6-AqABL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cropsticks","source_asin":"B06Y5BPRKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y5BPRKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y5BPRKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
