window.products.push({"id":947768,"name":"MIFXIN Tub Chair Slipcovers 2 Piece Stretch Printed Club Chair Cover with Cushion Cover Soft Spandex Round Barrel Chair Slipcovers Couch Protector for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71usL0S+1AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【Premium Tub Chair Cover】92% Polyester and 8% spandex, breathable, durable and stretchy, smooth and soft to touch, ensuring both good function and comfort. Various printed armchair covers for your choice as they update furniture to fit your evolving style. Suitable for kinds of decoration style, and decorate your barrel chair and make the living room more colorful. ✔【Upgraded 2-Piece Tub Chair Cover Set】MIFXIN 2-piece club chair cover is crafted from soft stretchy fabric, each pack includes 1 piece of base cover and 1 piece of the seat cushion cover. Smart 2-piece separate slipcover design provides a better fit and perfect stretch to all edges. Non-slip design with a sewn-in elastic bottom, make the hard-to-fit furniture easy to cover and keep slipcover stay in place firmly. ✔【Suitable Club Chair Size】Our club chair slipcovers are one size, fit Chair Height: 65-72cm/25.6\"-28.3\"; Chair Width: 65-75cm/25.6\"-29.5\"; Seat width: 65-75cm/25.6\"-29.5\"; Cushion Width: 45-52cm/17.7\"-20.5\". Suitable for most armchairs/barrel chair/club chair/tub chair. Easy to put on and off. Pls measure your armchair before buying to make best fit. ✔【Barrel Swivel Chair Protector & Home Décor】The tub chair slipcovers have variety of patterns design, transform your old, damaged or ugly chair a new look, match your living room house theme. And protect your chair from scratch, spill and accident, especially if you have the kids and pets. Best choice for both leather/fabric armchair furniture. ✔【Easy to Install】Check the installation guide carefully, barrel chair cover can be finished within 3 minutes by one person. These tub chair slipcovers are easy to remove from the armchair for washing. Hand wash or machine wash with cold water; Hang dry; No bleach; No ironing. Wash separately at gentle cycle. Using mild laundry detergent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71usL0S+1AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIFXIN","source_asin":"B0BDCR68LY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDCR68LY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDCR68LY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":947769,"name":"Cake Boss Stainless Steel Tools and Gadgets 9.75-Inch Offset Icing Spatula, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-95PgqRTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make sure not to waste one sweet dab of frosting with the Cake Boss Stainless Steel Tools and Gadgets 9-3/4-Inch Offset Icing Spatula. Decorating is so much easier with Cake Boss Tools and Gadgets and this icing spatula features an offset blade to help keep fingers and hands clear of frostings and buttercreams while icing cakes and cupcakes. The blade's stainless steel construction helps produce smooth, even results and cleans up easily. The icing spatula's rounded tip is ideal for smoothing lemon filling on each layer of a three-tiered cake and it features a comfortable rubberized handle for improved control, which comes in handy when icing a large wedding cake. The offset icing spatula is heat safe to 500 Degree F and is dishwasher safe, though hand washing is recommended. Add it to your assortment of Cake Boss Tools and Gadgets, along with the other great items in the entire collection. Whether for cute cupcakes or elegant special-event cakes, the Cake Boss Stainless Steel Tools and Gadgets 9-3/4-Inch Offset Icing Spatula helps create beautifully finished baked goods, while helping keep hands clear of frosting while decorating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-95PgqRTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cake Boss","source_asin":"B00FB9SFT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FB9SFT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FB9SFT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
