window.products.push({"id":947813,"name":"Digital Alarm Clock, Warmhoming 6.5'' Large Mirror Surface LED Alarm Clock with Snooze, Auto/Manual Dimmer and Dual USB Port for Charging","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HvbpG3GpL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Q&A: Customer reported issue: The display does not light up except when tilted sideways.  Root cause: wrong operation.  How you will address the root cause:  Please press and hold the “+” button for 3 seconds. After ‘OFF’ display for three seconds, switch to manual mode. In this mode, the light will stay on always.  Customer reported issue: The alarm does not stop beeping.The only way for me to turn it off is by unplugging it.  Root cause: wrong operation.  How you will address the root cause: Please press any button expect SNOOZE button, it will stop beeping when ring.  Customer reported issue: wouldn't allow me to set alarm.  Root cause: wrong operation.  How you will address the root cause:  a. Please press “M” button to enter alarm setting mode, then long press “M” button for 3 seconds to enter setting mode. The sequence is “HOUR - MINUTE - SNOOZE TIME SETTING MODE”.  b. In setup mode, the setting object is flashing.  c. Adjust the data using “+” or “-” buttons, after setting press “M” once to enter other mode.  d. Turn on and turn off AL alarm” Press “-” to select. (There is “AL” symol in display is on condition and no “AL” symbol is off condition)  e. Remark: when the AL time is set, the AL alarm symbol flashes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HvbpG3GpL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Warmhoming","source_asin":"B07Q129RBR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q129RBR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q129RBR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
