window.products.push({"id":947825,"name":"Versatile Cake Icing Frosting Smoother with Stand - Flexible Bowl Scraper Has Flat and Curved Edges to Easily Smooth, Mix, and Clean - All-In-One Past","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ftfiBxWLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ultimate Multipurpose Utensil: This smartly designed scraper for baking helps you do a lot more with less; It effortlessly smoothes icing and fondant, scrapes, divides batter, cleans the bottom and sides of bowls, wipes down counters, and so much more. A Breeze to Use and Store: The flexible, grippy surface makes it super easy to handle, which cuts down on both prep and cleanup time; When you are done, simply drop it in the top dishwasher rack or rinse under warm water; And thanks to its built-in stand, it can be stored upright to reduce clutter Cut Out for All Your Pastry Jobs: Whether you are using it as an icing smoother, or a cake spatula, this handy tool has a multitude of edge types, including flat, pointed & rounded, to get the job done - all in a sleek and compact form that’s only 4.7 x 5.3 inches SUPER FLEXBILE: It is much more flexible than a traditional dough scraper, making it ideal for batter. It's high flexibility means it can conform well to almost any bowl Essential Utensil for All Kitchens: At Chef Cum Laude, we are focused on creating a better baking experience for everyone; Our versatile scraper gives you unsurpassed functionality in a minimalist style, and makes a fantastic gift for your friends & family; Backed by a no-hassle one-year warranty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ftfiBxWLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef Cum Laude","source_asin":"B095RLWFPW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095RLWFPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095RLWFPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":947826,"name":"Eastwarmth All Seasons Luxury Goose Down Comforter Extremely Soft Duvet Insert, 100% Organic Cotton, Downproof Shell Solid White Full/Queen Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XxeRV0EtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tips for Use and Maintaining 1. Down and feather-filled products are packed tightly during shipping. It is normal that there is some smell when you take out products from package. A few hours of airing makes the odor gradually fade away and recovers fluffy. 2. Storage: Down comforter should be gently tapped for a while before using or collection, so that dust should be taken to avoid being trapped of old air. Keep it in a well-ventilated and dry place to prevent moisture. Do not put together with sharp objects. 3. Washcare: It is better not to clean the comforter frequently, so as not to damage the characteristics of its natural down&feather, and to keep the comforter clean, that is to use a cover. It is very easy to maintain down comforter of bedding. The method is the same as that of down jackets and other down products. All you need to do is to fluff it in the morning and then flatten it. This can dissipate moisture and sweat, and restore the original elasticity and bulkiness of the down. 4.Dry in the sun: Before using for the first time, please dry in the sun for 60 minutes. After using down comforter for one month or two months, put it in the sun for a while, but do not expose it to the sun. To prevent dust, you can use a cover for the down comforter. The time for drying the sun is best from 10:00 am to 3:00 pm, continuously even for 2-3 hours, and turn in the middle time, so that down comforter can be exposed inside and outside. Down comforter is warm, and has good hygroscopicity, sweat permeability, and is relatively dry. Because its weight is much lighter than cotton quilt, it does not cause a sense of oppression. Therefore, it is suitable for people who have high blood pressure, heart disease, poor blood circulation and the elderly, pregnant women, ect. We believe our down products can bring you a nice sleeping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XxeRV0EtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eastwarmth","source_asin":"B07L2VW51H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L2VW51H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L2VW51H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
