window.products.push({"id":947837,"name":"Ziplock Food Bag Storage Organizer, Acrylic Drawer Baggie Organizer Plastic Bag Dispenser Holder for Gallon Slider Quart Freezer Sandwich Snack, for Z","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BOmYNzsqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer: It is made of durable high quality 100% food-safe acrylic, Sturdy and wear-resistant material can meet your longer use. It is a fully assembled one-piece acrylic storage bag organizer box, with waterproof and easy-to-clean features. The transparent box is functional and helps you save space and organize all kinds of bags. Different Sizes Meet Fifferent Needs: Gallon organizer: 11.81 x 4.72 x 2.95 inch; Quart Organizer: 8.27 x 3.93 x 2.95 inch; Snack & Sandwich Organizer: 6.59 x 3.15 x 2.95 inch ; 7.28 x 3.55 x 2.95 inch; Freezer quart slider: 9.45 x 4.33x 2.95 inch; Please measure the size of your drawer in advance if you add the screws, and the height should be 3.3\" H at least. You can also put it on the kitchen countertop or storage shelf. Easy to Install: If you put it on the kitchen countertop or storage shelf, there are 4 strong adsorption magnets to fix it, you don’t worry about it will fall off when you pull out a bag. There are 2 holes on the back of each zip lock storage bag holder, you can also hang it on the wall. The packing provided the installation screws. Compatible with Most Brands of Bags: It contains 5 sizes of bag storage organizers, it can compatible with Ziploc, Solimo, Glad, and more bag brands. There is a laser logo on each box, which can be convenient for you to take the bag you want. Differences with Other Bag Storage Organizers: The acrylic ziplock food bag storage organizer is different from the fragile wooden boxes. It's durable and no installation is required, easily cleans and maintain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BOmYNzsqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aimayi","source_asin":"B0B9MTDJGP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9MTDJGP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9MTDJGP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
