window.products.push({"id":947925,"name":"RAYHOO Little Train USB Humidifier Desktop Mute Mini Personal Portable Small Humidifier Retro Outlook, For Office, Bedroom, Great Gift for Girls and K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51depHY-2aL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【IMPORTANT】: 1.First time to use, please soak the aborbent contton swab firstly before using, otherwise it will take a few minutes for abosrbing water automatically. 2.Do not add essential oil, purify water or distilled water in this mini humidifier, Do not open spray while without water. long-term water shortages can cause Humidifier burn out. 3. If used for a long time, the spray become smaller. Please try to remove the cotton swab and reinstall at the other end, or replace a new one. 【TECHNICAL FEATURES】: RAYHOO Little Train Mini USB Humidifier,Retro Outlook, Product material: ABS. Rated voltage: DC5V-1A, Input interface: DC3.5 . Rated power: 2W. Spray timing: 4 hours, Light timing: 1 hour. USB cable length: 1.2m, Product dimensin: 6.4*3.4*3.9 inches. Package include: 1*Humidifier, 1*User manual, 1*Filter and 1*USB cable. 【EASY OPERATION】: One touch control for all functions. 1. On: press the switch button, the spray starts working, colorful light is on. and there'll also be a train whistle sound. 2. Long press the switch button can tyrn off Colorful light. 3. off: Shortly press the switch button. and the Colorful light is automatically off after using for an hour, the humidifier is automatically off after using for 4 hours. Quiet Operation (<30dB) with no extra noise. 【Childlike design】Cartoon train design, high quality spray paint. Absolutely let you start to love it at the moment you got it. It is small, lightweight and easy to carry, suitable for different occasions, including bedroom, office desk, hotel. This mini humidifier works conveniently when connecting USB port with power wherever you are. Obviously, this is a great gift for yourself, your girls friend, your kids. 【QUALITY GUARANTEE】: Pack include: 1*Humidifier, 1*User manual, 1*Filter and 1*USB cable. One Year Warranty. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee -Please check the product manual for more product considerations. If the Humidifier is damaged during shipping or using, please feel free to contact\"Rayhoo\", we will help you to solve your problem or send the replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51depHY-2aL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RA RAYHOO","source_asin":"B07WLYCDMJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-947925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WLYCDMJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WLYCDMJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
